assert count_unique_once(["apple", "banana", "cherry"], ["banana", "cherry", "date"]) == 2
assert count_unique_once(["sun", "moon", "star"], ["moon", "sun", "planet"]) == 2

## Canonical Elixir names (use verbatim)
